_jW9E2Pxu_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRpoUK3u8HnLKOmWT62zm90Lx_1UIkRalZgkgCGyssQrQ&oe=6B06FC44"}, {"file_name": "screen-01.png", "id": "3727214050917114", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304764_3727214054250447_5465507135370727558_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ksrmyH3cK_UQ7kNvwH8J8yY&_nc_oc=Adp0zjB0K7Ovrq4m0iObdj7fn3ZZG18S28mgIDrah05Idv3G_rqxNZB6KmSZiDtO11g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSxllAA0wdfdwQcCGmvj21zccu5exRNfEVgsJ_i4crVAw&oe=6B07049B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR4VET Cloud Engineering", "keywords": ["vr4vet", "career", "cloud"], "long_description": "The VR4VET Cloud Engineering VR app simulates a cloud engineering workplace with different tasks to be performed in cloud engineering centre. The users can experience situations representing typical workplaces in a data and cloud engineering center, such as setting up tickets, selecting and replacing hardware components in different server cabinets.\n\nThe application can be used as a supplementary material for the end users integrated into the career guidance and vocational education practice. When in the application, the user takes the role of a trainee at a clould engineering center. The user is introduced to the profession and can engage in typical workplace tasks.\n\nThe app features:\n- Setting up tickets in a cloud engineering center\n- Working through different tickets in exchanging and replacing hardware components in a cloud engineering center\n- Completing different introduction tours to different hardware components and how to replace them\n", "short_description": "The VR4VET Cloud Engineering VR app simulates a cloud engineering workplace with different tasks to be performed in cloud engineering centre. The users can experience situations representing typical workplaces in a data and cloud engineeri